WEBVTT

00:00:03.187 --> 00:00:06.412
Open Tools, Features, and search for Telephony.

00:00:06.412 --> 00:00:08.847
The Telephony feature is the base:

00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:15.117
it adds the settings, the extensions and the connection between the browser and the phone system.

00:00:15.571 --> 00:00:18.072
The soft phone has its own features.

00:00:18.072 --> 00:00:22.361
One puts a phone button on every admin page, and another opens the

00:00:22.361 --> 00:00:26.351
phone in a small window of its own, which the phone apps use.

00:00:26.805 --> 00:00:29.557
Each phone system is a feature too.

00:00:29.557 --> 00:00:34.257
Turn on Telnyx, Asterisk, or both, and each one adds its own tab

00:00:34.257 --> 00:00:36.405
to the Telephony settings.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:41.281
By default, call recordings are stored on your site, encrypted.

00:00:41.281 --> 00:00:46.471
A feature called Telephony, Azure Blob Storage moves them to Azure instead.

00:00:46.471 --> 00:00:50.060
Your technical team turns it on and configures it.

